# HTB API & Datastore

## Auth & bases

```javascript
// config/htb.js — never hardcode URLs outside this file
HTB_API_BASE    // v4 — default https://labs.hackthebox.com/api/v4
HTB_API_V5_BASE // v5 — machine list pagination
HTB_APP_BASE    // https://app.hackthebox.com — profile/badge URLs
```

Token: `HTB_V4_TOKEN` (OAuth access JWT) + `HTB_REFRESH_TOKEN` (refresh). Auto-refresh via `POST ${HTB_API_BASE}/login/refresh`; persist to `HTB_TOKEN_FILE` JSON after each refresh. Invalid refresh → `HtbAuthError` (bot stays online, cache consultable).

## htb-api.js patterns

- All requests via `htbApiGet(endpointPath, parseText, { base })`
- Throttle per endpoint key (`getThrottleEndpointKey`); respect `x-ratelimit-*` headers
- Rate-limit waits logged at `info` when wait exceeds threshold
- Machine list: v5 paginated (`MACHINE_LIST_PAGE_SIZE=100`), profiles: v4 selective enrichment
- Normalize v5 machines with `normalizeV5Machine()` before storing
- Paginated responses: `extractPaginatedItems(response)` handles `data`/`message`/`info`

## SevenDatastore sync

```javascript
// Section order (never reorder without updating logs)
["machines", "specials", "tags", "team", "challenges"]

// Options
update()              // missing sections only
update({ force: true }) // team + missing deps
update({ full: true })  // everything
update({ sections: ["machines"] }) // explicit
```

- `force` ≠ `full`: force refreshes team members, not all machines/challenges
- `getMemberSyncDependencies()` auto-adds machines/challenges/specials if missing
- Specials stored in `MISC.FORTRESSES`, `MISC.ENDGAMES`, `MISC.PROLABS`
- After update: `syncDbExportFields()` + `updateCache()` in bot.js

## Adding a new HTB endpoint

1. Add method to `HtbApiConnector` in `htb-api.js`
2. Normalize response to match existing cache shape (see `api-classes.js` typedefs)
3. Wire into appropriate `update()` phase or on-demand getter in `SevenDatastore`
4. Add progress logging with `logBatchProgress()` for bulk fetches

## Env tuning

| Variable | Default | Purpose |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `HTB_LOG_PROGRESS_EVERY` | 25 | Bulk fetch progress interval |
| `HTB_MACHINE_PROFILE_CONCURRENCY` | 3 | Parallel profile fetches |
| `HTB_API_LOG_REQUESTS` | false | Verbose request logging |
| `HTB_RATE_LIMIT_WAIT_THRESHOLD_MS` | 3000 | When to log rate-limit waits |
